  "landing.channel3Text": "Midira handinika raharaha.",
  "landing.channel4Title": "Fandinihana fanampiny",
  "landing.channel4Text": "Manomana hevitra avy amin’ny sary rehefa nahazoana alalana.",
  "landing.faqLabel": "FANONTANIANA MAZÀN’NY OLONA",
  "landing.faqTitle": "Alohan’ny hanombohana.",
  "landing.faq1Question": "Mila kaonty ve vao mampandre?",
  "landing.faq1Answer": "Tsia. Mandeha tsy mila kaonty ny taratasy. Tehirizo ny kaody LV omena rehefa vita ny fandefasana mba hanaraha-maso ny raharaha.",
  "landing.faq2Question": "Didy ve ny valin’ny AI?",
  "landing.faq2Answer": "Tsia. Afaka manolotra hevitra ny fandinihana fa tsy mahavita manamarina filazana irery. Ny efitrano famoaham-baovao no manapa-kevitra.",
  "landing.faq3Question": "Inona no azoko alefa?",
  "landing.faq3Answer": "Mandray famaritana, lohahevitra, toe-javatra, ary sary na rohy ny prototype. Alefaso izay azonao zaraina ihany.",
  "landing.faq4Question": "Efa misy ve ny fampiharana finday?",
  "landing.faq4Answer": "Mifanaraka amin’ny finday ny pejy web. Tsy mbola navoaka ny APK; hovelomina ny bokotra rehefa vonona ny dika iray.",
  "landing.faq5Question": "Havoaka ve ny mombamomba ahy?",
  "landing.faq5Answer": "Tsy mangataka ny anaranao ny taratasy. Aza asiana vaovao saro-pady ao amin’ny lahatsoratra na ny sary. Jereo ny pejy momba ny tsiambaratelo.",
  "landing.closeLabel": "LAVERTA AVY AMIN’I URBIX",
  "landing.closeTitleA": "Fiandohana ny famantarana.",
  "landing.closeTitleB": "Zava-dehibe koa ny fanitsiana.",
  "landing.closeText": "Andramo ny lalana ho an’ny daholobe na jereo ny toeram-piasan’ny mpanao gazety.",
